        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061\\theta )=\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061\\theta \\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{cosh}\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061\\theta +C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061\\theta )=\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061\\theta \\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{sinh}\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (9\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061\\theta -7\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061\\theta )\\text{d}\\theta  & =\\int 9\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta +\\int -7\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =9\\int \\operatorname{sinh}\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta -7\\int \\operatorname{cosh}\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =9\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061\\theta -7\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
